        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin ENSEASQU-C4, Seattle Multi-Point Trim with Square Lever C4  with Profile Cylinder Below</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Seattle Multi-Point Trim with Square Lever C4 has 7-7/8 inch mounting centers. It is part of Baldwin's multi point configuration C4 collection which profile cylinder below the handle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) profile profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside, and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Seattle Entry Multi-Point Trim Door Configuration #C4:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 7-7/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Thickness: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordered Item. <B>Final Sale.</b></i>\r\n</p>",
